Q: Cannot get FlexiGrid for CodeIgniter to work A: <p>Not sure if you still need this help or not, and i'm not sure i'm the best to teach as i'm still new to PHP and don't know the most "secure" practices, however, the following is what I was able to do with flexgrid and may help future users, or spark a more "secure" idea from a more advanced user. Without further adieu, my solution:</p>

<p>In the javasript grabbing the and using the json is EASY, check it:
<em>keep in mind i tried to keep this very generic &amp; removed all possible personal values ... it think</em></p>

<pre><code>var flexset = {
    url:            'https://www.yourSite.com/index.php/yourController/yourDBFunc',
    dataType:       'json',
    colModel :      [
                        {display: 'A Column', name: 'a_col', width: 80, sortable: true, align: 'center'},   //  where name=the name of the column in the database
                        {display: 'Another Column', name: 'another_col', width: 110, sortable: false, align: 'center'}
                    ],
    buttons :       [ {name: "aButton", onpress: someFunction} ],
    searchitems :   [
                        {display: 'A Column (some more info if you want)', name: 'a_col', isdefault: true}, //  where name=the name of the column in the database
                        {display: 'Quantity', name: 'charge'}
                    ],
    sortname:       "a_col",    //  the name of the column in the database
    sortorder:      "desc", //  desc or asc
    usepager:       true,
    title:          'Some grid title',
    useRp:          true,
    rp:             20,
    showTableToggleBtn:     true,
